🏦 Bank Loan Analytics Dashboard | SQL + Power BI
An End-to-End Business Intelligence Project for Banking Loan Analysis

📌 Project Overview
The Bank Loan Analytics Dashboard is an end-to-end Business Intelligence project designed to analyze banking loan data and provide meaningful insights into loan performance, customer behavior, and lending risk.
Using SQL for data analysis and Power BI for visualization, this project transforms raw loan data into interactive dashboards that help financial institutions monitor key performance indicators (KPIs) and support data-driven decision-making.

🎯 Business Problem
Banks process thousands of loan applications every month. Managing this large volume of data manually makes it difficult to:
Monitor loan performance
Identify risky loans
Evaluate repayment trends
Analyze borrower behavior
Track monthly lending performance
Generate executive reports
This project solves these challenges by creating an interactive Power BI dashboard supported by SQL-based analysis.

🚀 Objectives
Analyze overall loan portfolio performance
Track loan applications and funded amounts
Monitor repayments and collections
Compare Good Loans vs Bad Loans
Analyze customer demographics
Evaluate monthly lending trends
Support executive decision-making through interactive dashboards

